        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Deletes the object it owns,\nand adopts (takes ownership of) the one passed in.\nSubclass must override: Base class does not delete the object.\n@param p simple pointer to an object that is adopted\n@stable ICU 4.4",
